      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 19,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2102.03334_p4_b26",
      "text": "ViLT has a succinct architecture as a VLP model with a\nminimal visual embedding pipeline and following the single-\nstream approach.\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.08,
        392.0,
        543.1,
        425.95
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        1228,
        1568,
        2172,
        1703
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.06,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 131,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2102.03334_p4_b27",
      "text": "We deviate from the literature that we initialize the inter-\naction transformer weights from pre-trained ViT instead\nof BERT. Such initialization exploits the power of the in-\nteraction layers to process visual features while lacking a\nseparate deep visual embedder. 4\n",
      "bbox": [
        306.97,
        433.85,
        543.09,
        491.7
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        1227,
        1735,
        2172,
        1966
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.06,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 268,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
