      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2102.03334_p4_b36",
      "text": "3Parameters for R50 is 25M, R101 is 44M, and X152 is 60M.\n4We also experimented with initializing the layers from BERT\nweights and using the pre-trained patch projection from ViT, but it\ndid not work.\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.12,
        675.94,
        541.72,
